00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:56,000
The Bug Man is a action film directed by Chai Meekunsut.

2
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:46,000
A Thai man marries a hill tribe girl who is kidnapped by gangsters.

3
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:36,000
Gus is a 1976 American sports comedy film released by Walt Disney Productions, distributed by Buena Vista
Distribution, directed by Vincent McEveety and starring Ed Asner, Don Knotts and Gary Grimes.

4
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:26,000
Its center character is Gus, a football-playing mule.

5
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:16,000
The film did well at the box office and was released on home video in 1981.
